    {
      "id": "p0139-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "After a lot of internal discussion, and after consulting with Toby, the team settled on using the term chiri to describe what monsters turn into after death.",
        "raw": "After a lot of internal discussion, and after consulting with Toby, the team\nsettled on using the term chiri to describe what monsters turn into after death.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08843178,
          0.42272857,
          0.69717816,
          0.45412857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0812467,
          0.42201429,
          0.70543794,
          0.4552
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          24,
          25
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "团队内部反复讨论，又征询了 Toby 的意见，最终决定用 chiri（尘埃）描述怪物死后化成的东西。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
