    {
      "id": "p0139-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "After the original English version of Underta/e was released, intrepid fans dissected the game's data and found a treasure trove of unused text, graphics, and more. As the localization team discovered, though, some of this unused text only went unused due to programming mistakes in the original release.",
        "raw": "After the original English version of Underta/e was released, intrepid fans\ndissected the game's data and found a treasure trove of unused text, graphics,\nand more. As the localization team discovered, though, some of this unused\ntext only went unused due to programming mistakes in the original release.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08891284,
          0.67068571,
          0.68762876,
          0.73852857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0812467,
          0.66997143,
          0.70543794,
          0.7396
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          38,
          39,
          40,
          41
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 原版英语游戏发行后，勇于探索的粉丝剖析了游戏数据，找出大量未使用的文本、图像等内容。但本地化团队发现，其中有些文字没能用上，只是因为原版程序出了错。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 9,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [],
