    {
      "id": "p0139-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "One such mistake occurs during the dramatic pre-battle encounter with Papyrus. If the player has spared Papryus in a previous run through the game, Papyrus is designed to have alternate dialogue about their previous meeting. It turns out that this line had a bug in it, though, so it didn't trigger during normal gameplay.",
        "raw": "One such mistake occurs during the dramatic pre-battle encounter with Papyrus.\nIf the player has spared Papryus in a previous run through the game, Papyrus is\ndesigned to have alternate dialogue about their previous meeting. It turns out\nthat this line had a bug in it, though, so it didn't trigger during normal gameplay.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09020247,
          0.75368571,
          0.7033909,
          0.82119286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0812467,
          0.75297143,
          0.70543794,
          0.82226429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          42,
          43,
          44,
          45
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "其中一处出现在与 Papyrus 开战前的戏剧性对峙。如果玩家在之前一轮游戏中饶恕过 Papyrus，按设计，他应该说出另一段台词，谈到两人之前的相遇。然而，这段台词存在漏洞，正常游玩时不会触发。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
