    {
      "id": "p0139-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although the localization team members knew how to fix this bug, they waited until Toby gave his approval to implement it. Thus, Papyrus' alternate dialogue now appears as designed in all versions of the game, on all platforms, in both English and in Japanese.",
        "raw": "Although the localization team members knew how to fix this bug, they waited\nuntil Toby gave his approval to implement it. Thus, Papyrus' alternate dialogue\nnow appears as designed in all versions of the game, on all platforms, in both\nEnglish and in Japanese.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08891284,
          0.83635714,
          0.70024871,
          0.90453571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0812467,
          0.83564286,
          0.70543794,
          0.90560714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          46,
          47,
          48,
          49
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "本地化团队虽然知道怎么修，仍然等 Toby 同意后才动手。因此，现在各平台的所有版本，无论英语还是日语，都会按原本的设计显示 Papyrus 的这段替代台词。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
